{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45030","headline":"遥和尘外上人与陆澧夜集山寺问湼盘义兼陆生文卷 · 皎然","name":"遥和尘外上人与陆澧夜集山寺问湼盘义兼陆生文卷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共是竹林贤，心从贝叶传。\n说经看月喻，开卷爱珠连。\n清净遥城外，萧疎古塔前。\n应随北山子，高顶枕云眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}